cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, please cite it as below."
title: "quant-math-roadmap: An 8-Week Quant Finance Math Roadmap"
abstract: >-
  A self-study, reproducible, and rigorous 8-week roadmap that builds the
  mathematical and methodological foundations for quantitative finance and
  systematic research. It covers returns and risk, linear algebra,
  multivariable calculus and portfolio optimisation, probability, statistical
  inference, regression, financial mathematics, time-series analysis, and
  leakage-controlled backtesting. The project is for education and research
  methodology only; it is not investment advice and makes no claim of trading
  profitability.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Quant Math Roadmap Contributors"
license: MIT
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-01-01"
keywords:
  - quantitative-finance
  - education
  - backtesting
  - time-series
  - statistics
  - regression
  - reproducible-research
